# Conventions

- Files kebab-case (`order-summary.tsx`), components PascalCase, functions/hooks camelCase, constants UPPER_SNAKE_CASE.
- Explicit types, short functions, issue-scoped diffs, no drive-by refactors. No secrets in code or comments.
- No comments that restate the code. Keep only non-obvious constraints, footguns and product decisions.
- Biome formats and lints (`pnpm check`). No `any` without a reason in a comment.
- Money is always integer minor units (TND millimes, EUR cents). Format with `formatMoney` from `@workspace/sdk`.
- Tests: `bun test` next to the code, one test per behavior, real Postgres for api tests (`DATABASE_URL`), mock only
  network and time. Run only touched packages while iterating.
- Accessibility: labelled controls, 44px touch targets, AA contrast, visible focus. Mobile first, then desktop.
